<http://example.org/academic/Person> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/academic/Person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Person" .
<http://example.org/academic/Person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A human individual." .
<http://example.org/academic/Professor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/academic/Professor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/academic/Person> .
<http://example.org/academic/Professor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Professor" .
<http://example.org/academic/Professor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A faculty member who teaches and conducts research." .
<http://example.org/academic/Student> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/academic/Student> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/academic/Person> .
<http://example.org/academic/Student> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Student" .
<http://example.org/academic/Student> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An individual enrolled in courses." .
<http://example.org/academic/Course> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/academic/Course> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Course" .
<http://example.org/academic/Course> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An academic course taught at university." .
<http://example.org/academic/University> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/academic/University> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "University" .
<http://example.org/academic/University> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An institution of higher education." .
<http://example.org/academic/teaches> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://example.org/academic/teaches> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "teaches" .
<http://example.org/academic/enrolledIn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://example.org/academic/enrolledIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "enrolled in" .
<http://example.org/academic/affiliatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://example.org/academic/affiliatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "affiliated with" .
<http://example.org/academic/advisor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://example.org/academic/advisor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "academic advisor" .
<http://example.org/academic/credits> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://example.org/academic/credits> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "credits" .
<http://example.org/academic/email> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://example.org/academic/email> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "email" .
<http://example.org/academic/AthensUniversity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/academic/University> .
<http://example.org/academic/AthensUniversity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Athens University" .
<http://example.org/academic/AthensUniversity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A prestigious public research university." .
<http://example.org/academic/DrSmith> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/academic/Professor> .
<http://example.org/academic/DrSmith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Dr. Alice Smith" .
<http://example.org/academic/DrSmith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Full Professor in Computer Science." .
<http://example.org/academic/DrSmith> <http://example.org/academic/affiliatedWith> <http://example.org/academic/AthensUniversity> .
<http://example.org/academic/DrSmith> <http://example.org/academic/email> "asmith@athens.edu"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://example.org/academic/CS101> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/academic/Course> .
<http://example.org/academic/CS101> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Introduction to Computer Science" .
<http://example.org/academic/CS101> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Introductory programming and algorithms course." .
<http://example.org/academic/CS101> <http://example.org/academic/credits> "6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<http://example.org/academic/DrSmith> <http://example.org/academic/teaches> <http://example.org/academic/CS101> .
<http://example.org/academic/Bob> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/academic/Student> .
<http://example.org/academic/Bob> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bob Jones" .
<http://example.org/academic/Bob> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Undergraduate computer science student." .
<http://example.org/academic/Bob> <http://example.org/academic/enrolledIn> <http://example.org/academic/CS101> .
<http://example.org/academic/Bob> <http://example.org/academic/advisor> <http://example.org/academic/DrSmith> .
<http://example.org/academic/Bob> <http://example.org/academic/affiliatedWith> <http://example.org/academic/AthensUniversity> .
<http://example.org/academic/Bob> <http://example.org/academic/email> "bjones@athens.edu"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://example.org/academic/Carol> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/academic/Student> .
<http://example.org/academic/Carol> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Carol White" .
<http://example.org/academic/Carol> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Graduate research student." .
<http://example.org/academic/Carol> <http://example.org/academic/enrolledIn> <http://example.org/academic/CS101> .
<http://example.org/academic/Carol> <http://example.org/academic/advisor> <http://example.org/academic/DrSmith> .
<http://example.org/academic/Carol> <http://example.org/academic/affiliatedWith> <http://example.org/academic/AthensUniversity> .
